applicants><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NAKAMURA MASATSUGU</name><address><country>JP</country> </address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NAKATA KATSUHIKO</name><address><country>JP</country> </address> </addressbook> </applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NISHIDA TERUO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SANTEN PHARMA CO LTD</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NAKAMURA, MASATSUGU</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NAKATA, KATSUHIKO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NISHIDA, TERUO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SANTEN PHARMACEUTICAL CO., LTD.</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NAKAMURA MASATSUGU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NAKATA KATSUHIKO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NISHIDA TERUO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NAKAMURA, MASATSUGU</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NAKATA, KATSUHIKO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NISHIDA, TERUO</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>Remedies for corneal disorders which contain as the active ingredient compounds having an effect of activating Rho (for example, corneal epithelium extension promoters). The compounds having the effect of activating Rho are exemplified by lysophatidic acid and acyl derivatives thereof. The corneal disorders are exemplified by a corneal ulcer, corneal epithelium scraping, corneitis and dry eye.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>La présente invention concerne des médicaments qui contiennent en tant qu'ingrédient actif des composés dont l'effet est d'activer Rho (par exemple, les promoteurs d'extension de l'épithélium cornéen). Les composés dont l'effet est d'activer Rho sont, à titre d'exemple représentatif, l'acide lysophatidique et ses dérivés acyle. Les troubles de la cornée concernés comprennent entre autres l'ulcère de la cornée, la lésion épithéliale de la cornée, la kératite et le syndrome de l'oeil sec.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>